{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20908","headline":"贵主征行乐 · 李贺","name":"贵主征行乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奚骑黄铜连锁甲，罗旗香干金画叶。\n中军留醉河阳城，娇嘶紫燕踏花行。\n春营骑将如红玉，走马捎鞭上空绿。\n女垣素月角吚吚，牙帐未开分锦衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}